  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>Dragite is a rare crystal that possesses special sonic properties, causing the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blades focused by Dragite Crystals to resonate loudly in combat. When you wield an attuned <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with a Dragite Crystal, you deal +1 die of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sonic\" title=\"Sonic\">Sonic</a> damage on critical hits with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> (This die of damage is added after damage is multiplied for the critical hit). </p>",
